WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Mobile: the search bar stays in the header.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.333
Open the page navigation drawer.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:08.167
Refresh shows loading and completion. Network delay is simulated.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.583
Expand a chapter to browse its pages.

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:12.417
The page tree scrolls independently of the article.

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:15.250
Choose a page; the drawer closes and reading continues.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.667
Reopen navigation at your current page.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.083
Tap the backdrop to return to the article.

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:24.333
Search stays in its familiar position at the top.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:27.167
Open the matching passage, with its source revision.

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:32.167
The sidebar opens the matching chapter automatically.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:36.250
Open and close navigation without losing your place.
